    "title": "The intake pilot",
    "content": "<!-- layout: title; theme: briefing; design: v1 -->\n# The intake pilot\n\nA shorter review cycle, with an unanswered quality question. [1][2]\n\n---\n\n<!-- layout: bar_chart -->\n## Review time fell from 40 to 16 hours [1]\n\nMedian review time, hours. [1]\n\n| Stage | Median (hours) |\n| --- | --- |\n| Before | 40 [1] |\n| **During the pilot** | 16 [1] |\n\nTwo teams, eight weeks. Quality and error rates were not measured. [1][2]",
